ated in '.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE' directory. Use the template content to structure the PR description and then call create_pull_request tool.\n</system-reminder>"}], "renderedRole": "system", "sessionId": "e0f002d9-e93b-5e8f-89ac-1e3fceebb58f", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:05:43.176Z", "type": "attachment", "userType": "external", "uuid": "6479d803-4b7b-4bde-9ccf-de8ca2d66766", "version": "2.1.325"}
